ad-source="docdb"  status="new" lang="FR">CARTOUCHE POUR BANDE MAGNETIQUE</invention-title><citations><patent-citations><patcit ucid="JP-11232826-A" status="new"><document-id status="new" format="epo"><country>JP</country><doc-number>11232826</doc-number><kind>A</kind></document-id><sources><source category="XP" name="SEA"  created-by-npl="N"/></sources></patcit></patent-citations><non-patent-citations><nplcit status="new"><text>See also references of EP     1162619A1</text><sources><source name="SEA"  created-by-npl="N"/></sources></nplcit></non-patent-citations></citations></technical-data><parties><applicants><applicant status="new"  format="epo"><addressbook><name>FUJI PHOTO FILM CO LTD</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>ISHIHARA YUSUKE</name><address><country>JP</country> </address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>MORITA KIYOO</name><address><country>JP</country> </address> </addressbook> </applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>SHIGA HIDEAKI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>FUJI PHOTO FILM CO., LTD.</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>ISHIHARA, YUSUKE</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MORITA, KIYOO</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SHIGA, HIDEAKI</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>ISHIHARA YUSUKE</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>MORITA KIYOO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>SHIGA HIDEAKI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>ISHIHARA, YUSUKE</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MORITA, KIYOO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SHIGA, HIDEAKI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A magnetic tape cartridge (1) including a cartridge case (4) accommodating rotably a single reel (7) on which a magnetic tape (6) having at its end a leader pin (5) secured to the end of the tape for drawing out the magnetic tape is wound, wherein the leader pin (5) has a tape clamp section (51) on which the magnetic tape is wound, a clamp member (55) having a slit extending axially and a C-shaped cross section is fitted elastically on the tape clamp section, the leader pin is secured to the end of the magnetic tape, a sheet member (8) for enhancing the coefficient of friction is interposed at least between the magnetic tape (6) and the tape clamp section (51).</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>Cette cartouche pour bande magnétique (1) est essentiellement constituée d'un boîtier-cartouche (4) où une unique bobine (7) est montée rotative. A l'extrémité de la bande magnétique (6) qui s'y enroule sur la bobine (7) est fixée une broche de saisie (5) permettant l'extraction de la bande. Cette broche de saisie (5) comporte un segment à pincer (51) sur lequel passe la bande magnétique. Une pince (55) constituée d'un élément de forme allongée à section en C dont la fente d'ouverture est longitudinale se pose en force à cheval sur la broche, retenant ainsi l'extrémité de la bande magnétique sur la broche. Un élément en surépaisseur (8) venant augmenter le coefficient de friction est disposé entre la bande magnétique (6) et le segment à pincer (51).</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>